{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787030376250853001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"silly-mystical-annelid","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":4,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"0c31505d9d4d0302f0426ea64daa9aa6c512b5faede7b74f1a06c9111660eff6","event_uuid":"7dcbfbef-bfdc-4a2f-9e14-50eff74edc5e","position":{"commit_sha":"9055450bcf03ef96d3ee6aca90cfe924221ee65e","position":"1787028379237708001-7dcbfbef-bfdc-4a2f-9e14-50eff74edc5e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7915096b36dbf633bc757e3e70f65e4bfb6d262f58d0319c3dadfd7fcae298b8","event_uuid":"89105bea-1674-4e9c-824a-9c80df04cd4e","position":{"commit_sha":"4c4a9ab7ed54180500ac0884d73a024993418d9b","position":"1787028398632763001-89105bea-1674-4e9c-824a-9c80df04cd4e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b8ecea421d120bec0901e93dcefd958bf544237cbba3494a38f0f0671be99287","event_uuid":"46b11c86-fb6b-49c0-aee0-e7db644cabe2","position":{"commit_sha":"42a48c3cd3442ee973cbfefc99cd62617834feea","position":"1787028405447228001-46b11c86-fb6b-49c0-aee0-e7db644cabe2"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"87f8f9755ffb3a22c74bf74a4f9dc0511262980a75d6541d15651f3409dc038d","event_uuid":"dabbdae7-ca53-43c1-848b-352878581d53","position":{"commit_sha":"77edd5be38aca9a40388e13f1faf207aa4b718f0","position":"1787028413412406001-dabbdae7-ca53-43c1-848b-352878581d53"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787028379237708001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"dabbdae7-ca53-43c1-848b-352878581d53","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"1cb3-d60c-0d32-4cfe"}],"description":"## Context\nThe create sequence must survive process restart without duplicate Jira issues, preserve index-lag grace, and release dependent links/children only after create and binding confirmation are proven.\n\n## Outcome\nRun the complete Cloud/DC crash-restart sequence twice, prove exactly one remote issue and one confirmed binding, then make coordinated create authoritative behind one internal family rollback selector.\n\n## Plan\n1. Compose pending, create, containment, confirmation, and RP-02 keyed/keyless recovery across fresh process/store instances.\n2. Preserve keyed recovery with zero search and keyless recovery with both three misses and 3600 seconds; one recovery failure cannot stop unrelated tickets.\n3. Hold create-before-link and parent-before-child dependents until proven create/confirmation; preserve tombstones, filters, and read-only modes.\n4. Venue-gate Cloud/DC verified-fake crash/restart tests, then switch the internal create-family default. Never run legacy and coordinator creates together.\n5. Preserve exact per-ticket tally, logs, known-key safety abort, and rollback by re-observation.\n\n## Testing\nDuplicate probes execute every fault cut twice with fresh state. Dependency and filter tables assert zero early effects and independent continuation.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every Cloud/DC crash-restart fault cut converges to exactly one remote issue and one confirmed forward/reverse binding.\n- [ ] Keyed recovery performs zero search.\n- [ ] Keyless negative search requires both three misses and 3600 seconds.\n- [ ] Per-entry recovery failure does not stop unrelated tickets.\n- [ ] Links and children wait for proven create/confirmation, while tombstones, filters, and read-only modes remain effective.\n- [ ] Create has one coordinator route and one internal legacy rollback value with no dual-send.\n\n## Out of scope\nFinal removal of legacy create helpers remains S5.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_outbound.py","reason":"Cut outbound create to the coordinator after validation."},{"path":"src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/apply_inbound.py","reason":"Cut inbound create and local lifecycle to the coordinator."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py","reason":"Cloud/DC whole-sequence crash-restart and dependency tests."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_write_ahead_recovery.py","reason":"Pending/keyed/keyless recovery regression coverage."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_index_lag_duplicate_heldout.py","reason":"Index-lag grace and duplicate prevention."},{"path":"tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_reconcile_filter.py","reason":"Filter/read-only zero-effect and dependency regressions."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","1cb3-d60c-0d32-4cfe"],["parent","59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["rp03","create","recovery","tdd"],"ticket_id":"2863-c335-4567-4430","ticket_type":"task","title":"RP-03 S4 T3 — Prove restart convergence and cut over create coordination","verify_commands":[{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/mutate/test_create_operation_coordinator.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/orchestrate/test_reconcile_filter.py","dd_id":"AC1,AC4-AC6","dd_text":"Crash/restart uniqueness, independent recovery, dependency/filter behavior, and create cutover"},{"command":"env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/pytest -q tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_write_ahead_recovery.py tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_index_lag_duplicate_heldout.py","dd_id":"AC2-AC3","dd_text":"Keyed/keyless recovery and index-lag grace"}]},"source_event_uuids":["7dcbfbef-bfdc-4a2f-9e14-50eff74edc5e","89105bea-1674-4e9c-824a-9c80df04cd4e","46b11c86-fb6b-49c0-aee0-e7db644cabe2","dabbdae7-ca53-43c1-848b-352878581d53"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787030376250853001,"uuid":"6ac57491-b3a5-4fb4-b20f-598cfbdef7a6"}